  "content": "<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img\n    width=\"50%\"\n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db40482722d3dd46277aa9aee8e2dc86bcb3f704_0.webp\"\n    alt=\"釣魚線附魔\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1905c438a7c4965489077cac7feaca06385cad12.png\"\n    alt=\"功能\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n<section>\n  <p>\n    <b>釣魚線附魔</b> 徹底重構了 Minecraft 的釣魚線。 \n    它用高度逼真、物理模擬的 3D 繩線取代了僵硬的細線。 \n    它在重力作用下會下垂，會動態彎曲，並且能完美碰撞方塊而不穿模。\n    <br>\n    <b>100% 客户端側</b>\n  </p>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n    <img width=\"40%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6559c78833608f3dcef211a6ab680bc09de7df0a.png\" alt=\"功能\"/></a>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\" style=\"margin:6px 0;\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/punchy-fpa\">\n  <img alt=\"punchy\" width=\"30%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d5640b938aec7675e8196b98a6cbc419c757417b.png\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bceb25df5ca5f8aa9553252af9df39c163b8494e.png\"\n    alt=\"功能\"\n  />\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img width=\"220px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ea072819f1659d34a258504c02cdf7cd4f5b7650.png\" alt=\"功能\" />\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f6cabf7aedfaa7af461930011a2f6c86166a6fac.png\" alt=\"魚線物理\" /> \n<p>\n<b>真實的線體物理：</b>釣魚線現在會在重力下垂擺並隨你的移動而彎曲。它取代了直的 vanilla 線，改為模擬的 3D 線體。\n</p>\n<br>\n\n<img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ef749686a39b65c1b1026ee8728163e1718cd95d.png\" alt=\"方塊碰撞\" />  \n<p>\n<b>方塊碰撞：</b>當你把餌拋過牆或扔在地上時，線會與方塊碰撞並落在地形上，而不是穿模過去。\n</p>\n<br>\n\n<img width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/319640fe6349317901ad3f1fc8a5572555d403c5.png\" alt=\"動態鬆弛\" />  \n<b>動態松弛：</b>如果你靠近餌，線自然就會垂落在地上；若你拉遠，線則會重新拉緊。\n</p>\n\n</div>\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bceb25df5ca5f8aa9553252af9df39c163b8494e.png\"\n    alt=\"功能\"\n  />\n\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<section>\n  <h3>授權</h3>\n  ARR (所有保留權利)<br>\n  您允許將此 MOD 包含於 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 的整合包中而無需徵求許可。<br>\n  重新分配 jar 檔案是被禁止的。\n</section>\n</div>",
